# DOCKER_SETUP.md documents a Windows workflow; CI (build.yml, deploy.yml)
# runs on ubuntu-latest. Without this, a formatting/whitespace-sensitive
# check can pass locally on Windows (CRLF) and fail in CI (expects LF), or
# vice versa — normalize line endings to LF in the repo and let each
# checkout convert back to the platform default.
* text=auto eol=lf
